					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-600253#post-2014327</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-600253/rusted-nightmares#post-2014327</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2014 21:00:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Anborough</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1568690</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I find myself coming back to this tale with a new way of seeing things. I think that the only thing keeping all those people down there is each other. They don't want to be left alone, and that collective will is what stops each other from leaving. The only anomaly on that ship is the fear and loneliness of the people themselves, manifested as rust.</p> <p><em>Stay with us.</em></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
