				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-600253#post-1642825</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-600253/rusted-nightmares#post-1642825</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 08 Dec 2012 16:30:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Boulder Smolder</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1262568</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I interpreted it as subtly &quot;wrong&quot;; flakes of rust are forming on and floating off the floor to suggest how bizarre and sinister the physics of the boat are getting. Think the transition to the Silent Hill &quot;other world&quot;.</p> <p>This wasn't the author's intent, but I still like that idea.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
